      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Acute appendicitis. Acute appendicitis is often suspected but in 70% of the cases the complaints to an other diagnosis. Aggressive therapy is therefore not indicated. A 12 to 24 h observation allows to avoid surgery and complications which are not exceptional."},
